# Update nerdctl

1. Download latest release from [github](https://github.com/containerd/nerdctl/releases/)

2. Extract tarball into `~/.local/`
```
tar Cxzvvf ~/.local nerdctl-full-2.2.1-linux-amd64.tar.gz 
```

# Update k3s

1. Download latest release from [github](https://github.com/k3s-io/k3s/releases/)

```
curl -L https://github.com/k3s-io/k3s/releases/download/v1.35.1%2Bk3s1/k3s -o ~/.local/bin/k3s
```

2. 
```
chmod +x ~/.local/bin/k3s
```

# Restart k3s

```
systemctl --user restart k3s-rootless.service 
```
